BEDCA Food Composition Dataset — License
=========================================

Dataset: BEDCA Food Composition Dataset (retrieved August 2026)
Contents: 957 foods, 31,166 component values, from the Spanish Food
Composition Database (BEDCA v1.0) published on the web by AESAN/BEDCA.
The data is documented per the EuroFIR specifications (June 2009).

Source: AESAN/BEDCA Base de Datos Española de Composición de Alimentos v1.0 (2010)
Site:   https://www.bedca.net/
Contact for error reports: bedca.adm@gmail.com

Attribution (required on any reproduction):

    AESAN/BEDCA Base de Datos Española de Composición de Alimentos v1.0 (2010)

Conditions of use (per the AESAN/BEDCA "Condiciones de uso", v 1.0):

1. The information may not be reproduced without clear indication of the
   original source (the attribution above).

2. The data may not be modified, nor may its original meaning be altered.
   Accordingly, all values in this dataset are stored verbatim, exactly as
   returned by the source database.

3. Reproduction, translation, or any use other than personal, educational,
   or non-commercial use of the data in electronic format is subject to the
   express authorization of AESAN/BEDCA.

4. Neither AESAN nor BEDCA assumes any responsibility for the data, its
   documentation, or its subsequent use — including its use in software or
   in combination with other websites.

